Bootstrap: docker
From: python:3.12-slim

%labels
    Description VisIVO VR pairing service (visivo-pair/1)

%help
    The VisIVO VR pairing service, for hosts without Docker.
    Build (in services/vr-pair/):  apptainer build vr-pair.sif vr-pair.def
    Run:  VR_PAIR_BIND=127.0.0.1 VR_PAIR_PORT=8765 \
          VR_PAIR_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://vr.example.org \
          apptainer run vr-pair.sif
    Configuration through the VR_PAIR_* variables: see README.md.

%files
    requirements.txt /app/requirements.txt
    vr_pair_service.py /app/vr_pair_service.py

%post
    pip install --no-cache-dir -r /app/requirements.txt

%environment
    export PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1
    export PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1

%runscript
    exec python /app/vr_pair_service.py "$@"

%startscript
    exec python /app/vr_pair_service.py
